<title>USA: Frisch's Restaurants Q1 shr rises to $0.21.</title>
<headline>Frisch's Restaurants Q1 shr rises to $0.21.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>9/22/96		     9/17/95</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.21		    $0.13</p>
<p> Net			  1,427			882</p>
<p> Revs			51,730		   52,666</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,883		    6,883</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Frisch's Restaurants Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company has 16 weeks in its first quarter.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement higher payroll expense due to tight labor markets continued to pressure margins but increased labor costs were offset by improved operating costs. Expenses were also reduced because of a reduction in new restaurant construction, it said.</p>
</text>
